# Local working notes. Glob, not an exact name: the file was split per phase
# (UPSTREAM_BUGS_PHASE_0-2, _PHASE_3-6) and the exact-match rule silently stopped
# covering them, so `git add -A` would have committed both.
UPSTREAM_BUGS*.md